  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-19T20:20:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:findingType "meta_infrastructure" ;
  triage:correlatedWith <urn:atm:triage:finding/HARD-MERGE-GATE-LOC> ;
  triage:correlatedWith <urn:atm:triage:finding/AG24-LOC-GATE> ;
  triage:correlatedWith <urn:atm:triage:finding/AG25-LOC-GATE> ;
  triage:correlatedWith <urn:atm:triage:finding/RBQA-F009> ;
  triage:correlatedWith <urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-AG24-003> ;
  triage:notes "dispatchReady=false: the gate crate is not yet relocated off develop into a worktree (relocation instruction sent to arch-ctm 2026-07-19), so there is no branch to promote this finding to yet. Once arch-ctm reports the relocation branch+SHA, re-triage with triage_mode=followup_pass to set promoteTo and dispatch this alongside any remaining AG18-25 ladder fix rounds. Treat as required reading for whoever reviews the first real PR on the atm-architecture crate -- do not let this design ship as the 'fix' for the ladder failure without addressing items 1, 4, and 7 at minimum." .
